@id n1_edwin
# DRAFT
# Edwin, the novice, on the west walk at dusk (night 1), an armful of rushlights. The porter's friend; talks too fast.
# The relic and the pilgrims (he never sees one leave); his novice's week; and, if the porter saw the shape
# at the squint on night 0 (n0_squint_scare), the lane's horned demon, which had no horns.
== start
(A young brother hurries down the west walk with an armful of rushlights and nearly walks into you.)
Edwin {glad}: Sorry! You're the porter. Alric? I'm Edwin, novice. Everyone's been talking about you. Well, Brother Osric has.
Edwin {glad, brow}: Is it true you came in through Aldgate on a cart? I've never been past Aldgate. I've never been past Cheapside.
-> topics

== again
Edwin {glad}: You're back! I've still got all these to put out. Walk with me?
-> topics

== topics
* [if not n1_edwin_relic] Tell me about the relic. -> relic
* [if not n1_edwin_duties] What does a novice do all day? -> duties
* [if n0_squint_scare] [if not n1_edwin_squint] Last night, through a squint, I saw something tall inside the wall. -> squint

== relic [set n1_edwin_relic]
Edwin {glad}: You haven't seen it? The saint's own finger, in a silver hand on the high altar. With the candles behind it, it glows.
Edwin {amused}: Brother Ranulf won't let me near it. He says I breathe too hard.
Edwin {warm}: Pilgrims come to it from Kent, from Essex. They pray, they sleep in the guesthouse, and they're gone before I'm up.
Edwin {grave}: I've never once seen one leave. They're just not there.
-> topics

== duties [set n1_edwin_duties]
Edwin {amused}: Psalms. Psalms, and more psalms. I've forty by heart, and they tell me forty isn't a hundred and fifty.
Edwin {amused, brow}: And I'm reader at supper this week, up in the pulpit. So don't make me laugh. I mean it, Alric.
-> topics

== squint [set n1_edwin_squint] [trust edwin 5]
Edwin {amused}: Inside our wall? At night? (He laughs, and then he doesn't.)
Edwin {warm}: Tall? That's the lane's demon, with the horns. Jankin's been seeing it for years.
(You tell him it had no horns.)
Edwin {afraid, swallow}: No horns? (He's quiet a moment, which isn't like him.) Then I don't know what you saw.
-> topics

== leave
Edwin {glad}: See you at supper! Don't make me laugh!
